. * HYPOTHESIS TEST FOR H4 * 
. // The dependent variable is a standardised index of gender equality
. // Higher values indicate more support for gender equality
. // Variable of interest is the interaction of the variables daughters 
. // (if respondents only have daughters vs. only sons) interacted with 
. // an indicator of the respondent being a man
. 
. // We run a linear OLS regression analysis with additional 
.         // pre-determined covariates
.         
. reg std_index_H1 daughters##man i.age_first_birth i.migback i.l11101 ///
> i.pgpsbil i.num_child i.age_old_child [aw=phrf], vce(cluster hid)
